    "title_en": "About P-adic Numbers and Professor Igor Volovich on the Occasion of his 80th Anniversary",
    "abstract_en": "We recall a 1987 paper written by Volovich and our subsequent work with Okada which established the Feyman rules for the p-adic string and the related non-local field theory which found diverse physical applications. We add some memories of visits to Moscow during 1989-91.",
